config MT6628
	tristate "MediaTek MT6628 SDIO bring-up"
	depends on MMC && CFG80211
	select CRC32
	select FW_LOADER
	help
	  Initialize WLAN firmware and radio policy on MediaTek MT6628 SDIO devices.
	  This driver is under development. Station interfaces and scanning
	  are available; association and packet delivery are pending.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here. The module
	  will be called mt6628.
